        "task": "## Goal\n\nCreate a minimal Vue 3 application that provides a fast, bounded implementation target for SPADE's real issue-to-PR workflow prototype.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Scaffold a Vue 3 application with TypeScript and Vite in the repository root.\n- Replace the starter presentation with a simple page headed `SPADE workflow fixture` and a short sentence explaining that the repository exercises an agent issue-to-PR workflow.\n- Keep the implementation limited to the scaffold and this presentation; add no router, state library, backend, or unrelated features.\n- Commit the generated npm lockfile.\n- Document the development and production-build commands in the README.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- `npm install` succeeds from a clean checkout.\n- `npm run build` succeeds.\n- The application renders the required heading and explanatory copy.",
